EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Huh? Oh, hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I didn't know you were around.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Have you been here long?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Today is pretty much devoid of 
sunlight. {{TAG:0003:0015:}}It's been dark like this {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
since morning. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿Eh? Ah, ¡hola, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}No sabía que andabas por aquí.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¿Llevas mucho rato con nosotros?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hoy no vamos a ver la luz del sol
ni un poquito, {{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡llevamos a oscuras
desde por la mañana, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Eh? Oh ehi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Non sapevo fossi da queste parti.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sei qui da molto?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Non si può dire che la giornata
di oggi sia luminosa. {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Era così buio
anche stamattina! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
